    "body": "\u7248\u672c 0.1.98\r\n\r\n\u57fa\u4e8e 98GB \u7684\u591a\u8bed\u8a00\u8bed\u6599\u8fdb\u884c\u8bad\u7ec3\uff0c\u51fa\u73b0\u5982\u4e0b\u6bb5\u9519\u8bef\uff1a\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6084282/237049386-e8fc876a-1284-4f1d-82bc-0b1bb45e4901.png)\r\n\r\n\u53c2\u6570\u8bbe\u7f6e\u5982\u4e0b\uff1a\r\n\r\n--model_type=bpe \\\r\n--max_sentence_length=41920 \\\r\n--pad_id=3 \\\r\n--train_extremely_large_corpus=true \\\r\n--control_symbols=\"<sep>,<endofprompt>\" \\\r\n--num_threads=128 \\\r\n--byte_fallback=true \\",
